taught through example, through proclamations, and even through performances, like ballads.An accessible look at late medieval London through the lens of civic ceremonies and dispute resolution, Ceremony and Civility synthesizes archival research in London with existing scholarship to show how newcomers in an ever-shifting population were enculturated into premodern London.},
	publisher = {Oxford University Press},
	author = {Hanawalt, Barbara A. and Hanawalt, Barbara A.},
	month = aug,
	year = {2017},
}

